.TH GSEA 2 2000-1月 "enrichment.go" "enrichment.go"
.SH NAME
enrichment.go \- Do the GO (Gene Ontology) GSEA enrichment analysis.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIenrichment.go(\fBbackground\fR as <generic> Background, 
\fBgeneSet\fR as string, 
\fBgo\fR as any, 
\fBshowProgress\fR as boolean = TRUE, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Do the GO (Gene Ontology) GSEA enrichment analysis.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBbackground\fB \fR\- the GSEA background model that contains the GO terms, for example the model created by \fBdag.background\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgeneSet\fB \fR\- the gene id list for the enrichment analysis.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgo\fB \fR\- the go database object can be the raw go obo data or the DAG graph model.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBshowProgress\fB \fR\- prints the progress message? Default \fBTRUE\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
an array of the [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult) objects, which is sorted by
 the \fBFDR\fR value in ascending order.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GSEA
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
